<item><title>Tunisia solidarity event backs Chaima Issa and political prisoners</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-solidarity-event-backs-chaima-issa-and-political-cf7834/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-solidarity-event-backs-chaima-issa-and-political-cf7834/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>The Tunis gathering is part of a campaign running through 10 December, after rights groups said Issa began a hunger strike on 16 November.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:09:21 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tunisia wins seat on chemical weapons watchdog’s executive council</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-wins-seat-on-chemical-weapons-watchdog-s-executive-ddcd3f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-wins-seat-on-chemical-weapons-watchdog-s-executive-ddcd3f/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>The country was elected on 24 November as one of five African members for the 2027-2029 term, replacing no incumbent named in the report.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:36:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tunis examines plans to renovate Habib-Bourguiba Avenue</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunis-examines-plans-to-renovate-habib-bourguiba-avenue-cf7805/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunis-examines-plans-to-renovate-habib-bourguiba-avenue-cf7805/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>Proposals cover pavements, green spaces, lighting and pedestrian movement, but the municipality has announced neither a budget nor a construction timetable.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:17:55 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tunisia Telecom and Ericsson honour green hackathon winners</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-telecom-and-ericsson-honour-green-hackathon-winners-041fca/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-telecom-and-ericsson-honour-green-hackathon-winners-041fca/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>About 100 participants competed over two days at the Tunisian-Swedish event for gaming concepts linked to sustainability and recycling.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:15:55 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
